# AgitWarrior's no-desire hook: an Oel Mahum Berserker (35428) standing out of the character's
# sight, with nothing to do, wants to wander, trying a walk every 5 s, with weight 5. An NPC
# first idles on its second AI cycle. Its move-finished look around is covered by
# tests/ai/agit_warrior_test.go, as the format cannot hold an NPC to one walk.
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.AgitWarrior.AgitWarrior
npc berserker 35428 Monster 1000 0 0 walks

tick x2
  desires berserker wander()=5
